+# p2mr-ts M4 vectors
+
+`p2mr_ts_m4_spend.json` and `p2mr_ts_m4_construction.json` are copies, byte for byte, of
+`vectors/m4/p2mr_m4_spend.json` and `vectors/m4/p2mr_m4_construction.json` of p2mr-ts, the
+TypeScript P2MR library, from its support for these rules, which is not published yet. p2mr-ts
+generated them (`scripts/generate-m4-vectors.ts`) with its own SLH-DSA (@noble/post-quantum) and
+BIP 341 code, independently of this code base.
+
+| File | SHA-256 |
+|---|---|
+| `p2mr_ts_m4_spend.json` | `779b18690bdace0497eca16ddcd800f51da1c4c6b045f02fa3533238e35b6b97` |
+| `p2mr_ts_m4_construction.json` | `4e72f92e41cec195145cb791e95223cdd85711c6033d8839f5ccf9ca7e34d3ab` |
+
+The copies are replaced only on purpose, together with these hashes.
+`src/test/p2mr_ts_m4_tests.cpp` checks them.
